    h1 Gout
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/gout/symptoms-causes/syc-20372897") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Gout is a common and complex form of arthritis that can affect anyone. It's characterized by sudden, severe attacks of pain, swelling, redness and tenderness in one or more joints, most often in the big toe.
